# Runtime API key for Secure MCP Tunnel.
# Create at https://platform.openai.com/settings/organization/api-keys
# Required permission: Tunnels Read + Use.
# Load with: set -a; source .env; set +a  (or export before scripts/start.sh)
CONTROL_PLANE_API_KEY=

# Tunnel ID lives in profiles/hamza-local-dev.yaml (control_plane.tunnel_id).
# Create the tunnel at https://platform.openai.com/settings/organization/tunnels
# or with: tunnel-client admin tunnels create (requires OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY, Tunnels Read + Manage).
# OPENAI_ADMIN_KEY is for tunnel CRUD only, never for the long-lived daemon.